# Purpose: Identify the four longest jobs in a workflow export to guide runner and dependency-cache tuning.
# Inputs: ci/job-durations.json is a CI job summary with elapsed seconds and completion result.
# Outputs: The four longest jobs, including their outcome, in descending elapsed time.
accept job_durations_path as text with default "ci/job-durations.json"
run cat with path job_durations_path
then jq with flags ["-r"] and filter "[.jobs[]] | sort_by(-.duration_seconds)[:4][] | \"\\(.duration_seconds)s\\t\\(.result)\\t\\(.name)\""
